---
import DefaultLayout from '../../layouts/DefaultLayout.astro';
---

<DefaultLayout
  title="Community"
  subtitle="Stay in touch with the Wicket community"
>

  <p>
    Apache Wicket has a large and active community with over twenty years of development and
    thousands of developers building great Wicket applications around the world. Here you can
    find how to get help, contribute, and stay connected.
  </p>

  <div class="not-prose mt-8 space-y-6">

    <!-- Top row: 2 large cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">

      <!-- Mailing Lists card -->
      <div class="group p-8 border border-black/[0.06] rounded-lg bg-white hover:border-wicket-orange hover:shadow-[0_8px_32px_rgba(232,84,46,0.06)] hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-[#2a2320] to-[#3a3330] flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-4">
          ✉️
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-2 group-hover:text-wicket-orange transition-colors">Mailing Lists</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-warm-mid leading-relaxed mb-5">
          The mailing lists are the primary way to ask questions and discuss Wicket. Many experienced
          Wicket developers are subscribed and ready to help.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div>
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink mb-1">Users List</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-warm-mid mb-2">Ask questions and help other users. Announcements and security updates also sent here.</p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs">
              <a href="mailto:users@wicket.apache.org" class="text-wicket-orange hover:underline font-mono">users@wicket.apache.org</a>
              <span class="text-warm-light">·</span>
              <a href="mailto:users-subscribe@wicket.apache.org?subject=Subscribe+to+Apache+Wicket+User+list" class="text-warm-mid hover:text-wicket-orange transition-colors">Subscribe</a>
              <span class="text-warm-light">·</span>
              <a href="https://lists.apache.org/list.html?users@wicket.apache.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-warm-mid hover:text-wicket-orange transition-colors">Archives</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="border-t border-black/[0.06] pt-4">
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink mb-1">Developers List</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-warm-mid mb-2">Discuss internals, propose new features, and follow development activity. Low-traffic list.</p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs">
              <a href="mailto:dev@wicket.apache.org" class="text-wicket-orange hover:underline font-mono">dev@wicket.apache.org</a>
              <span class="text-warm-light">·</span>
              <a href="mailto:dev-subscribe@wicket.apache.org?subject=Subscribe+to+Apache+Wicket+Dev+list" class="text-warm-mid hover:text-wicket-orange transition-colors">Subscribe</a>
              <span class="text-warm-light">·</span>
              <a href="https://lists.apache.org/list.html?dev@wicket.apache.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-warm-mid hover:text-wicket-orange transition-colors">Archives</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- GitHub & Source card -->
      <div class="group p-8 border border-black/[0.06] rounded-lg bg-white hover:border-wicket-orange hover:shadow-[0_8px_32px_rgba(232,84,46,0.06)] hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1a1a2a] to-[#2a2a3a] flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-4">
          🐙
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-2 group-hover:text-wicket-orange transition-colors">GitHub &amp; Source</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-warm-mid leading-relaxed mb-5">
          The Apache Wicket source code is hosted on GitHub. Browse the code, open issues,
          and submit pull requests.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div>
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink mb-1">Apache Wicket</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-warm-mid mb-2">The core framework repository.</p>
            <a href="https://github.com/apache/wicket" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
               class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs text-wicket-orange hover:underline font-mono">
              github.com/apache/wicket ↗
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="border-t border-black/[0.06] pt-4">
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink mb-1">WicketStuff</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-warm-mid mb-2">
              Community sub-projects covering integrations with popular JavaScript frameworks,
              async tasks, RESTful apps, and much more.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 text-xs">
              <a href="https://github.com/wicketstuff/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
                 class="text-wicket-orange hover:underline font-mono">github.com/wicketstuff ↗</a>
              <a href="https://github.com/wicketstuff/core/wiki" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
                 class="text-warm-mid hover:text-wicket-orange transition-colors">WicketStuff sub-projects overview ↗</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom row: 3 smaller cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">

      <!-- Chat card -->
      <div class="group p-6 border border-black/[0.06] rounded-lg bg-white hover:border-wicket-orange hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1a2a1a] to-[#2a3a2a] flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-3">
          💬
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-bold text-ink mb-1 group-hover:text-wicket-orange transition-colors">Chat</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-warm-mid leading-relaxed">
          Join the <strong class="text-ink">#wicket</strong> IRC channel on
          <a href="https://freenode.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-wicket-orange hover:underline">Freenode</a>
          for more direct discussions. Note that time zones may affect activity levels.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Contributing card -->
      <a href="/community/contributing"
         class="group p-6 border border-black/[0.06] rounded-lg bg-white hover:border-wicket-orange hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all no-underline">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-[#2a2320] to-[#3a3330] flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-3 text-wicket-orange">
          🛠
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-bold text-ink mb-1 group-hover:text-wicket-orange transition-colors">Contributing</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-warm-mid leading-relaxed">
          Want to help make Wicket better? From answering questions on the mailing list to
          submitting code patches — all contributions are welcome.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-3 text-xs text-wicket-orange font-medium">How to contribute →</div>
      </a>

      <!-- Security card -->
      <div class="group p-6 border border-black/[0.06] rounded-lg bg-white hover:border-wicket-orange hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-[#2a1a1a] to-[#3a2a2a] flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-3">
          🔒
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-bold text-ink mb-1 group-hover:text-wicket-orange transition-colors">Security</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-warm-mid leading-relaxed mb-3">
          Found a vulnerability? Follow the Apache Software Foundation's responsible disclosure process.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 text-xs">
          <a href="https://www.apache.org/security/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
             class="text-wicket-orange hover:underline">Apache Security Process ↗</a>
          <a href="mailto:security@apache.org"
             class="text-warm-mid hover:text-wicket-orange transition-colors">security@apache.org</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <h2>Projects Built with Wicket</h2>
  <p>
    Curious about who else is using Wicket?
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/community/who-uses-wicket">Who Uses Wicket</a></li>
  </ul>

</DefaultLayout>
